      <mxCell id="cell_5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#b45309; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;ĐƠN ĐĂNG KÝ (REGISTRATION)&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;Hồ sơ chờ duyệt (Slide 18)&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #f59e0b; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• * Mã đơn đăng ký&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • Thời điểm nộp đơn&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • Trạng thái xét duyệt (pending/approved/rejected)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • Lý do từ chối (nếu có)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • Cán bộ xét duyệt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
