      <mxCell id="cell_6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#6d28d9; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;📁 feedback/{feedbackId}&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;Collection đánh giá khảo sát&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #8b5cf6; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • id: string [PK]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • eventId: string [FK ➔ events.id, Index]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • userId: string [FK ➔ users.id]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • ticketId: string [FK ➔ tickets.id, Unique]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • rating: number [1..5, Required]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • comment: string [Text]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • createdAt: timestamp&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#8b5cf6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="355" height="250" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#1d4ed8; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;📁 certificates/{certId}&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;Collection chứng nhận e-Certificate&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #3b82f6; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • id: string [PK, CERT-XXXX]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • eventId: string [FK ➔ events.id]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • userId: string [FK ➔ users.id, Index]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • pdfStoragePath: string [&amp;quot;reports/{uid}/...&amp;quot;]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • sha256Checksum: string [64-char Hash]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • issuedAt: timestamp&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="425" y="430" width="365" height="250" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;📁 clubs/{clubId}&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;Collection danh mục CLB&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #64748b; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • id: string [PK, &amp;quot;fcode&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;cocsaigon&amp;quot;]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • name: string [Tên chính thức]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • acronym: string [&amp;quot;F-Code&amp;quot;]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • category: string [&amp;quot;Technology&amp;quot; | &amp;quot;Media&amp;quot;]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • followerCount: number&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • logoUrl: string, fanpageUrl: string&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="820" y="430" width="365" height="250" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#6d28d9; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;📁 events/{id}/questions/{qId}&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;Subcollection Q&amp;amp;A hội trường trực tiếp&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #8b5cf6; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • id: string [PK]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • authorId: string [FK ➔ users.id]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • authorName: string&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • question: string [Nội dung]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • upvotes: number [Default: 0]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • isAnswered: boolean [Default: false]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• • createdAt: timestamp&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#8b5cf6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="1215" y="430" width="365" height="250" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;CHỈ MỤC PHỨC HỢP (COMPOUND INDEXES) &amp;amp; BẢO MẬT FIRESTORE SECURITY RULES:&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;Tối ưu hóa hiệu năng truy vấn sub-second và bảo vệ dữ liệu ở mức cơ sở dữ liệu đám mây&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #64748b; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 1. Compound Index: tickets ➔ userId (ASC) + isUsed (ASC) + createdAt (DESC) — Tối ưu truy vấn phân tách vé &amp;quot;Sắp diễn ra&amp;quot; (isUsed:false) và &amp;quot;Đã tham gia&amp;quot; (isUsed:true).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 2. Compound Index: events ➔ status (ASC) + date (ASC) — Hỗ trợ lọc danh sách sự kiện theo trạng thái vận hành và thứ tự thời gian.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 3. Compound Index: registrations ➔ eventId (ASC) + status (ASC) + createdAt (DESC) — Tối ưu hiển thị bảng Hàng chờ duyệt vé (Slide 18) trên Web Portal.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 4. Firestore Security Rule: allow read: if request.auth != null &amp;amp;&amp;amp; request.auth.token.email.matches(&amp;quot;.*@fpt[.]edu[.]vn$|.*@fe[.]edu[.]vn$&amp;quot;); — Khóa chặt truy cập.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 5. Atomic Check-in Rule: Chỉ cho phép cập nhật isUsed: true nếu document trước đó có isUsed == false, chặn hoàn toàn xung đột ghi đè đồng thời (Write Conflict).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="710" width="1530" height="360" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
    </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
